# The live address, with no trailing slash. Every absolute link is built from it: the
# canonical URL, the share image Facebook and WhatsApp show, the sitemap and robots.txt.
# If the domain ever changes, change this one line (or set the same variable in
# Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables, which takes precedence) and redeploy.
